        {"zh": "猎物，我的网已经准备好！", "en": "Prey, my web is ready!"},
        {"zh": "你将在我网中挣扎！", "en": "You will struggle in my web!"},
        {"zh": "线已经缠到你脚踝上了。", "en": "The thread is already on your ankle."},
        {"zh": "我只用一根手指就能拉紧。", "en": "One finger is enough to pull it taut."},
        {"zh": "你越挣，网收得越快。", "en": "The more you struggle, the faster the web tightens."},
        {"zh": "我数着你还剩几口气。", "en": "I count the breaths you have left."}
